CATEGORIES:children,play,toddler,museum,family
DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\\nCost: Fre
 e\\nAges: 0-60 months\\nCategory: Play & Games\\n\\nSanta is coming! He tr
 avelled all the way down from the North Pole\, come say hello and take Hol
 iday pictures! \nJoin us for a free evening where children and caretakers
  are invited to play in a sensory-friendly\, neuro-affirming environment! 
 We encourage the whole family to attend\, and therapists can join as well.
 \nNeurodivergent Family Nights are held on the second Tuesday and fourth T
 hursday of each month from 5-7 pm (after we close to general admission)\nS
 pace is Limited.\nOn these nights\, we dim the lights in the museum\, turn
  off the sounds\, and offer a limited capacity of 250 guests. Staff are ha
 ppy and ready to assist with providing various materials\, including noi
 se-cancelling headphones\, fidget toys\, sunglasses\, and weighted materia
 ls for your convenience. \nRSVP COMING SOON\n*Registration is required an
 d opens two weeks before each event. \nPlay Partners TBD\\n\\nMore info: 
 https://www.pretendcity.org/events/neurodivergent-family-night-4-2026-11-2
 6-2026-12-17/
LOCATION:Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\, 29 Hubble\, Irvine\, CA
 \, 92618
URL:https://www.pretendcity.org/events/neurodivergent-family-night-4-2026-
 11-26-2026-12-17/
